261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Over the past years, it has been one of the greatest honors of my life to serve as your Mayor. When I look back on where Vineyard started and where we are today, I am filled with gratitude for your trust, your ideas, your patience, your advocacy, and your deep love for this remarkable community we call home.)
/E (Over the past years, it has been one of the greatest honors of my life to serve as your Mayor. When I look back on where Vineyard started and where we are today, I am filled with gratitude for your trust, your ideas, your patience, your advocacy, and your deep love for this remarkable community we call home.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Together, we have watched Vineyard grow from a small town with only a few roads into a vibrant, connected city. We have welcomed incredible businesses and commercial anchors, invested in our beautiful shoreline, and preserved the open spaces that define us.)
/E (Together, we have watched Vineyard grow from a small town with only a few roads into a vibrant, connected city. We have welcomed incredible businesses and commercial anchors, invested in our beautiful shoreline, and preserved the open spaces that define us.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
