264 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (We have built safe, beautiful neighborhoods; created parks and trails where we gather; and designed and laid the core infrastructure, road networks, and transportation systems that support our burgeoning community. We have set the foundation for a dynamic downtown that will serve Vineyard for generations.)
/E (We have built safe, beautiful neighborhoods; created parks and trails where we gather; and designed and laid the core infrastructure, road networks, and transportation systems that support our burgeoning community. We have set the foundation for a dynamic downtown that will serve Vineyard for generations.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In Vineyard, we built strong communication channels and developed the groundwork for our systems and city code. We have developed lasting relationships by working hand-in-hand with regional partners, schools, businesses, and nonprofits to bring new opportunities, services, and amenities to our residents. We innovated for the future while staying rooted in the heritage that defines Vineyard.)
/E (In Vineyard, we built strong communication channels and developed the groundwork for our systems and city code. We have developed lasting relationships by working hand-in-hand with regional partners, schools, businesses, and nonprofits to bring new opportunities, services, and amenities to our residents. We innovated for the future while staying rooted in the heritage that defines Vineyard.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
266 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (We removed federal, state, and local barriers and deregulated in smart, strategic ways that created a vibrant environment for commercial growth. We opened doors to homeownership for young students, families, and retirees. We preserved spaces that honor the generations who came before us, provide quiet refuge, and offer meaning for our children. Vineyard has become a place where you can get your start, raise a family, retire, and rest.)
/E (We removed federal, state, and local barriers and deregulated in smart, strategic ways that created a vibrant environment for commercial growth. We opened doors to homeownership for young students, families, and retirees. We preserved spaces that honor the generations who came before us, provide quiet refuge, and offer meaning for our children. Vineyard has become a place where you can get your start, raise a family, retire, and rest.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Together, as a community, we have built a city that is financially secure, where public safety keeps pace with our quality of life, and where long-term infrastructure investments in our redevelopment agency continue to uphold strong free-market principles. Our youth have become an impactful force in our community, driving projects and practices that strengthen the future for the next generation. Volunteers have dedicated their time and talents to planning, culture, the arts, and incredible recreation opportunities, shaping the character and qualities of our city and creating the community that brought us all here.)
/E (Together, as a community, we have built a city that is financially secure, where public safety keeps pace with our quality of life, and where long-term infrastructure investments in our redevelopment agency continue to uphold strong free-market principles. Our youth have become an impactful force in our community, driving projects and practices that strengthen the future for the next generation. Volunteers have dedicated their time and talents to planning, culture, the arts, and incredible recreation opportunities, shaping the character and qualities of our city and creating the community that brought us all here.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [11]
>>
